WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.708
This card is practice, not a live alert.

00:00:02.708 --> 00:00:06.703
The important action is to follow local emergency managers.

00:00:06.703 --> 00:00:10.833
If local officials tell you to evacuate, do that immediately.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:14.760
That instruction is separate from later flood-water steps.
